1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,456
Terror From Destiny: there's no Killer. Something is trying to kill them, in a very

2
00:00:04,456 --> 00:00:05,207
specific order.

3
00:00:05,427 --> 00:00:07,731
Here's how the vignette plays, with any Location.

4
00:00:08,567 --> 00:00:12,838
There's no Killer board. Line up the two Bloodlust cards beside the Location board,

5
00:00:12,838 --> 00:00:15,308
with the marker on START. Horror starts at five.

6
00:00:15,528 --> 00:00:18,512
For the Terror deck, set the five Fated Death cards aside.

7
00:00:18,512 --> 00:00:22,473
Shuffle the vignette's other Terror cards with the Location's and deal eight.

8
00:00:22,473 --> 00:00:26,795
Put one aside, shuffle the other seven with the Fated Deaths, then put the set-aside

9
00:00:26,795 --> 00:00:30,653
card on top. That's thirteen cards, and the top one is never a Fated Death.

10
00:00:30,873 --> 00:00:34,460
Add the Thwart Destiny card and one Premonition card to the Tableau.

11
00:00:34,460 --> 00:00:36,676
For an easier game, add both Premonitions.

12
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:41,705
Choose a random Death Order card and put the five Death tokens face down on its

13
00:00:41,705 --> 00:00:42,663
circles, shuffled.

14
00:00:42,883 --> 00:00:47,304
Lay five Consequence cards face down in a row, with a Punishment card below each,

15
00:00:47,304 --> 00:00:50,307
and put the Arrow token above the leftmost Consequence.

16
00:00:50,527 --> 00:00:54,089
Then place the Victims and yourself from the Setup card, but no Killer.

17
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:58,914
Lay the Setup Grid rulers along the left and bottom edges of the board, matching the

18
00:00:58,914 --> 00:00:59,679
coloured arrows.

19
00:00:59,899 --> 00:01:04,434
For each of the five Fated Victims, roll two dice, one for each ruler, and place the

20
00:01:04,434 --> 00:01:07,835
square token on a space at least half inside that grid section.

21
00:01:08,055 --> 00:01:12,411
It can't go in your space, on an exit, or where another Fated Victim already is.

22
00:01:12,411 --> 00:01:14,263
If there's no legal space, reroll.

23
00:01:15,067 --> 00:01:18,410
Your goal is to save the five Fated Victims, in the right order.

24
00:01:18,410 --> 00:01:22,747
They move and follow like normal Victims, but can't be replaced by Special Victims.

25
00:01:22,967 --> 00:01:25,399
When one leaves by an exit, it isn't saved yet.

26
00:01:25,399 --> 00:01:29,694
Put its token on the first Death token on the Death Order card that doesn't already

27
00:01:29,694 --> 00:01:33,057
have a Fated Victim on it. Whether you saved it is decided later.

28
00:01:33,277 --> 00:01:37,722
If a Fated Victim dies to anything other than a Fated Death card, put its token in

29
00:01:37,722 --> 00:01:40,704
Limbo on the Bloodlust card. Don't raise Bloodlust yet:

30
00:01:40,704 --> 00:01:43,197
that happens when its Death token is revealed.

31
00:01:44,033 --> 00:01:47,953
When you draw a Fated Death Terror card, look at the next Death token on the Death

32
00:01:47,953 --> 00:01:50,583
Order card, starting at START and following the arrows.

33
00:01:50,803 --> 00:01:53,596
If a Fated Victim token is on it, set that aside.

34
00:01:53,596 --> 00:01:57,245
Then flip the Death token face up. It shows who fate kills next.

35
00:01:58,067 --> 00:02:01,090
If nobody was on the Death token, find the Victim it shows.

36
00:02:01,090 --> 00:02:04,421
If they're in Limbo, suffer the card's Limbo penalty, two health.

37
00:02:04,421 --> 00:02:08,521
Then kill them, wherever they are, even if location rules say Victims can't die.

38
00:02:08,521 --> 00:02:12,467
Raise Bloodlust, and put their token on the Consequence card under the Arrow.

39
00:02:12,687 --> 00:02:15,664
If the Fated Victim you set aside matches, they're saved:

40
00:02:15,664 --> 00:02:19,999
take the Saved reward, two health, put the token on your Final Girl card, and apply

41
00:02:19,999 --> 00:02:23,289
the normal save effects at the start of your next Action phase.

42
00:02:23,509 --> 00:02:25,977
If they don't match, you saved them out of order.

43
00:02:25,977 --> 00:02:30,055
Kill the Victim on the Death token as before, and the one you set aside goes into

44
00:02:30,055 --> 00:02:30,357
Limbo.

45
00:02:30,577 --> 00:02:34,642
Finally, discard the Death token and move the Arrow one Consequence card to the

46
00:02:34,642 --> 00:02:34,951
right.

47
00:02:35,767 --> 00:02:40,169
Ginny draws a Fated Death. The cheerleader's token sits on the next Death token, so

48
00:02:40,169 --> 00:02:44,518
she sets it aside and flips the token. It's the rebel, whom she also saved, but in

49
00:02:44,518 --> 00:02:45,367
the wrong order.

50
00:02:45,587 --> 00:02:49,831
The rebel is killed, Bloodlust rises, and his token goes on the Consequence card

51
00:02:49,831 --> 00:02:52,325
under the Arrow. The cheerleader goes to Limbo.

52
00:02:52,325 --> 00:02:53,757
Then the Arrow moves right.

53
00:02:54,567 --> 00:02:58,001
The Death Order card shows what happens when the Destiny symbol appears.

54
00:02:58,221 --> 00:03:01,554
Treat every Killer Action on a Terror card as a Destiny symbol.

55
00:03:01,554 --> 00:03:03,828
Two Killer Actions mean resolving it twice.

56
00:03:03,828 --> 00:03:05,944
Ignore any other Killer-related effects.

57
00:03:06,164 --> 00:03:10,645
Thwart Destiny costs one Time and can be played in any phase to ignore one Destiny

58
00:03:10,645 --> 00:03:11,028
symbol.

59
00:03:11,833 --> 00:03:16,105
Once no Fated Victims are left on the board, draw and resolve two Terror cards every

60
00:03:16,105 --> 00:03:17,529
Killer phase instead of one.

61
00:03:17,749 --> 00:03:22,202
The Hourglass of Despair Dark Power makes it cost three Time for a Fated Victim to

62
00:03:22,202 --> 00:03:23,125
leave by an exit.

63
00:03:23,345 --> 00:03:25,733
Premonition lets you flip Unknowns face up:

64
00:03:25,733 --> 00:03:30,342
a Death token, a Consequence or Punishment card, the next Terror or Event card, the

65
00:03:30,342 --> 00:03:34,951
top Item card or the Dark Power. Use it to learn the Death Order before you commit.

66
00:03:35,767 --> 00:03:38,534
After the last Terror card, the game ends at once.

67
00:03:38,534 --> 00:03:41,356
There's no Finale. Instead comes the Destiny phase.

68
00:03:41,576 --> 00:03:45,515
Going left to right, resolve each Consequence card with a Fated Victim on it.

69
00:03:45,515 --> 00:03:49,811
Flip it, and if you can't meet its demand, reveal the Punishment card below and lose

70
00:03:49,811 --> 00:03:54,006
that much health. For example, you must have saved at least five ordinary Victims,

71
00:03:54,006 --> 00:03:55,080
or lose three health.

72
00:03:55,300 --> 00:03:59,093
If your Final Health flips and you come back, ignore the rest of that Punishment.

73
00:03:59,093 --> 00:04:01,060
If you're still alive at the end, you win.

74
00:04:01,867 --> 00:04:05,655
A few tips. Use Premonition early to reveal the Death Order before you start

75
00:04:05,655 --> 00:04:07,051
escorting Fated Victims out.

76
00:04:07,271 --> 00:04:11,601
Bank health and Items for the Destiny phase, because Consequences can cost a lot.

77
00:04:11,821 --> 00:04:14,452
Players win about eighty per cent of logged games.

78
00:04:14,452 --> 00:04:14,979
Good luck.

